    {
      "path": "DECISIONS.md",
      "title": "Decisions",
      "lines": 334,
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2026-10-05 — A card module must have one loader, not two",
          "anchor": "2026-10-05--a-card-module-must-have-one-loader-not-two"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2026-09-03 — day_start was gating the wrong thing, and its reset was broken anyway",
          "anchor": "2026-09-03--day_start-was-gating-the-wrong-thing-and-its-reset-was-broken-anyway"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2026-09-01 — The card was rebuilding its whole shadow DOM on every hass push",
          "anchor": "2026-09-01--the-card-was-rebuilding-its-whole-shadow-dom-on-every-hass-push"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2026-08-23 — The custom amount is typed on the card, not in a browser prompt",
          "anchor": "2026-08-23--the-custom-amount-is-typed-on-the-card-not-in-a-browser-prompt"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2026-08-23 — The card editor is built on ha-form",
          "anchor": "2026-08-23--the-card-editor-is-built-on-ha-form"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2026-08-23 — The two blueprint copies are reconciled, and guarded by tests",
          "anchor": "2026-08-23--the-two-blueprint-copies-are-reconciled-and-guarded-by-tests"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2026-08-23 — This repo has packaging tests now, and they found three more faults",
          "anchor": "2026-08-23--this-repo-has-packaging-tests-now-and-they-found-three-more-faults"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2026-08-31 — The percentage moved into the cup, and needed two of itself to do it",
          "anchor": "2026-08-31--the-percentage-moved-into-the-cup-and-needed-two-of-itself-to-do-it"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2026-09-01 — An empty cup was drawing water, and five places recorded the wrong formula",
          "anchor": "2026-09-01--an-empty-cup-was-drawing-water-and-five-places-recorded-the-wrong-formula"
        }
      ]
    },
